 'Which sentence describes the two equal squares correctly?', ['Both squares are the same size.','Both square is the same size.','Both squares is the same size.'],0,'Both takes the plural squares and the plural verb are.',
 'Although the photograph is larger, the small dark title attracts strong attention. What does although signal?', ['A result that may seem unexpected.','Two elements must be identical.','The title is physically heavier.'],0,'Although recognizes that size alone does not determine perceived visual weight.',
